
// Definition of words
RSpace   = [\s\t]*
//RWord    = \w+
RWord    = [0-9A-Za-z_]+
RComment = \/\/[^\n]*
RAssign  = \=
RReg     = [^\n]+

RUnFold  = \*
ROption  = \?
RHide    = \.
RRaw     = \@

RNewLine = \n
RMorphe  = \>
// Note easy definition of
// all symbols have to be escaped
// \w Word so [A-Za-z0-9_]
// \n will be newLine
// . will be anything
// + will be match more/any




// Morphing definition
_       > Start*
Start   > Expr RNewLine. Start*
Start   > RNewLine. Start*?
Start   > Expr

Expr    > RComment
Expr    > RWord RSpace. RAssign RSpace. RReg
Expr    > RWord RSpace. RMorphe RSpace. List?
List    > MorWord RSpace. List*?

MorWord > RWord MorList?
MorList > RUnFold MorList*?
MorList > RRaw    MorList*?
MorList > RHide   MorList*?
MorList > ROption MorList*?

